      "note": [
        "From 2022 about 20, 000 positions have been moved from Other activities to Human health activities.",
        "Refers to employees aged 18–68 for whom we can report salaries. From 2023, the upper age limit has been increased from 66 years to 68 years.\r\nFrom 2014, the age demarcation has been increased from 18–64 years to 18–66 years.",
        "From 2025, Danderyds Sjukhus AB, S:t Eriks Ögonsjukhus AB,  Södersjukhuset AB and Södertälje Sjukhus AB were added to Region Stockholm, with a total of 13,000 employees.",
        "All numbers are rounded to the nearest hundred, unless the number is under 1000 and then the numbers are rounded to the nearest ten. The salary information is rounded to the nearest hundred. Totals are calculated before rounding."
      ],
